          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra didnâ€™t know if that was really true but she would like to think that it would be for Adora. And if Adora was okay than she would be okay too, right?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Valentine's Day 'Challenge': An Update Every Day Until Valentine's Day.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
